  "texts": [
    {
      "spokenText": "Alors je ne prendrai pas le poulet frit. Quelle option sans arachides me conseillez-vous ?",
      "textSHA256": "399790f2f9990f49859340faf0afcb5b981fcd840735a7de08b4c89fcf9a77f0",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:8:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Combien coûte le kilo, à peu près ?",
      "textSHA256": "f07fc89c5dd84d7cf46b86c0e029368837231f049774da1d3013bf5a970ba088",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:7:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 16
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Désolée, je crois que le poulet est cru à l'intérieur ; je ne peux pas le manger comme ça.",
      "textSHA256": "fb18c10b006267dc1a0c9e73770c97a5711eab48534d6a4536d50118edfabce8",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 15
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "D’après ce poids, voici le prix total estimé.",
      "textSHA256": "fcf683569b48470fd733f95d05bfc96cd2b13a116f6722a3675d898077ef9c06",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:7:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 10
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je ne critique pas la cuisine, je veux juste régler le problème.",
      "textSHA256": "9254e59d4c2ee8472e839200d55c6769b091edb9cc7fa8e138b388b5a14de96b",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 20
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je prendrai la salade. Combien coûte le kilo, à peu près ?",
      "textSHA256": "cf3dab7980b7c1f60f595dfc61ef078a31db0f671976a1162052e0e317cdd430",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:7:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 7
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je vais vérifier le temps d’attente et revenir vous le confirmer.",
      "textSHA256": "de0c2cc98a4a53b3b5a9478fdd25eaef09ce080faadce5e34f2109f41989f392",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 12
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je voudrais la viande à point, s’il vous plaît.",
      "textSHA256": "0ffe0e04fca47eea4048237a52e8e39bc2e542db582225b589017c5c3517b7c0",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:7:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 19
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Le poulet grillé, sans sauce, est une autre option.",
      "textSHA256": "12798fad0a4dba84d22794b43465544b0033963f55bfd3d89c4e7edaee49b955",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:8:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Le prix du kilo est indiqué ici. Celui-ci pèse environ un kilo.",
      "textSHA256": "f85af16b1eae1e20f1877f8330d0ca5ad7fe4e42c5af1467eb10fa1e5fcd5d4d",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:7:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Merci beaucoup d’avoir corrigé les plats.",
      "textSHA256": "a907c717541fbe6617ef0b153db0d533f2a8c68bffc08873b8610b1c38804bb6",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 14
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Pour le dessert, je reposerai la question avant de commander.",
      "textSHA256": "e1769d271dbc9dccb78c85644bcdec25b43680ebb6d451820832dfcfb976c5ea",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:8:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 18
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:8:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 12
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Pourriez-vous demander au chef de le faire cuire davantage ?",
      "textSHA256": "f3edd5e379e6e30dfec963241b0ccd1735c278e124dded5423bd9a7faa184e7e",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 16
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Pourriez-vous me remplacer ce plat, s'il vous plaît ?",
      "textSHA256": "c4a582dca0fb7ed958dabb9c3b507f29072383180f41d1e831ac5badc44e1563",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Pouvez-vous demander au cuisinier, s’il vous plaît ?",
      "textSHA256": "a65679736734bd92f98eb3991a325a363e0b9552171edf8f361df3d90d6c635b",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:8:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 16
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Quelle option sans arachides me conseillez-vous ?",
      "textSHA256": "7c1822c709dd27b4d9e31d832ea6ab958c9379d0e8688579dc7156bbaadab1cc",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:8:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 19
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Si les nouveaux plats prennent trop de temps, pourriez-vous nous dire combien de temps il reste ?",
      "textSHA256": "47c03238384c74d9ab09a355433c597dab5be893e247e52d03ea2d8b04f708f0",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 11
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Voici les plats corrigés. Le poulet est cuit à cœur cette fois.",
      "textSHA256": "b56e5980077245bb92d5f689cddbb1f48fb5d6b5891efe68c739935ed2cc2d1c",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 13
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "la cuisson de la viande",
      "textSHA256": "d057393679cefb275d8052b62f6881da4a29aeb08b9d60441e9e8c56981b24b9",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:7:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 20
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "le chef",
      "textSHA256": "8d89e36a3b0258c38d0499a76f8e598a90ca96da1872f75aa195ffff23d26f93",
